# Canonical repository paths

This workspace no longer uses flat product folders under `E:\Repos`.

Use these paths:

- Project Kylo: `E:\Repos\products\project-kylo`
- Greg Kylo: `E:\Repos\products\greg-kylo`
- Growflow: `E:\Repos\products\growflow`
- COG allocation: `E:\Repos\products\cog-allocation`
- AI Lab: `E:\Repos\products\ai-lab`
- AI Lab governance: `E:\Repos\products\ai-lab-governance`
- Kylo site: `E:\Repos\products\kylo-site`
- GIGATT Geomapper: `E:\Repos\products\gigatt-geomapper`
- Obsidian Brain: `E:\Repos\internal\obsidian-brain\Obsidian\Brain`
- Migration helpers: `E:\Repos\tools\migration`

Never generate commands against retired flat paths such as `E:\Repos\Project-Kylo`, `E:\Repos\Growflow`, `E:\Repos\ai-lab`, or `E:\Repos\Ai`.

If another rule or open file cites flat `Growflow/`, `Ai/`, or `E:\Repos\ai-lab`, rewrite via `docs/REPO_PATH_MIGRATION.md` before running commands.

Exception: `C:\Project-Kylo` is an intentional power-1 runtime alias, not the Acheron source checkout.

Before cross-repo edits, read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/REPO_PATH_MIGRATION.md`. Prefer `REPOS_ROOT` and the shared path helpers over hardcoded sibling assumptions.
